msgctxt "92"
msgid "Eww, get away from us, you creep!"
msgstr ""
"Che schifo, allontanati da noi,\r\n"
"pervertito!"

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Nami? Who's Nami? I don't know any girls named Nami."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Oh... *sniff* I'm sorry to bother you... I just heard\r\n"
"that my daughter Nami might be here in Kamurocho..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Piss off, punks. Leave the guy alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Oh, shit! Yo, this guy's not fuckin' around! Let's get\r\n"
"outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"You all right? Not to offend, but you don't really look\r\n"
"like you belong here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Thank you. I don't know what would've happened if you\r\n"
"hadn't stopped to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Why'd you pick a fight with those punks, anyway? What do\r\n"
"you need from guys like them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I'm embarrassed to even speak of it... but my dear Nami\r\n"
"ran away from home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Nami? That your daughter or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Oh, right, I'm sorry. I'm just so used to everyone knowing\r\n"
"who she is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Right. So you're looking for this Nami of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"That's right. I asked some of her friends if they'd seen\r\n"
"her, and they told me they'd seen her in Kamurocho..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"I thought that some of the young women here might have\r\n"
"seen her or heard of her, but every time I try to ask\r\n"
"someone for help, they start calling me a creep..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"Not surprised. An old guy like you, approaching young women\r\n"
"on the street? No wonder they're getting the wrong idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"I suppose you're right... Those kids must think I'm some old\r\n"
"pimp looking for fresh meat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"I never imagined Nami would run away from home. But I\r\n"
"suppose even 20-year-old girls can become runaways..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Do you have any clues as to where she might've gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"I just assumed that I'd eventually find her walking\r\n"
"along this busy thoroughfare..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Really? You don't have any specific leads as to where\r\n"
"she might've gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, I don't... She didn't leave any hints as to\r\n"
"where she was going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "You have no real way of finding her, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"I know, you're right... But I worry about her. I don't\r\n"
"think she had any money when she left, so I have no idea\r\n"
"how she's getting by..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"No money, huh? Well, if she really is staying here in\r\n"
"Kamurocho, she's probably working part-time to keep herself\r\n"
"afloat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"That makes sense... She could support herself for a while if\r\n"
" she took on a part-time job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"...Wait a second. There's only one kind of job a homeless\r\n"
"girl could find in Kamurocho..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "...No, she wouldn't⑬ Would she!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "*sigh* She would, wouldn't she..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "...Yeah, she probably would."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Shady clubs would be the only places willing to hire someone\r\n"
"with no permanent address."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"Eh, it's not as bad as you think. Nowadays, clubs are more\r\n"
"careful about who they hire. They're not picking up every\r\n"
"homeless girl on the street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "I hope you're right..."
msgstr "Spero che tu abbia ragione."

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"Looking for a good time? Come down to Honey! It's a whole new kind of "
"telephone club!"
msgstr ""
"Cerchi del divertimento? Vieni da Honey! È un tipo di telephone club tutto "
"nuovo!"

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Hmm? What's so different about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"With Honey, you don't even have to go to the club! Just call\r\n"
"our exclusive phone line, and you'll be automatically\r\n"
"connected to one of our sweethearts!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"Say goodbye to the \"walk of shame\" as you exit a club! And\r\n"
"don't worry, our club welcomes all men, both young\r\n"
"and mature!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Mature? How old do you think I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm so sorry! In any case, you should definitely give\r\n"
"it a try! Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Honey's Tissues<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Tissues for a telephone club... That's strangely poetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"Huh? Hey, look what's written on the package. \"We accept\r\n"
"all female applicants, regardless of age or residence\r\n"
"status.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Do you think Nami might be working at a telephone club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "It's not out of the question, I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Please, sir, what's your name!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for all your advice! I'm going to try\r\n"
"and find Nami at a telephone club!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Hey, man, wait⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's right! Here's my number. I'll have to personally\r\n"
"thank you if we end up finding her! Right then, I'm off⑬\r\n"
"call me later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Look, that's fine, but⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "I've got to get to a telephone club! Thank you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"(Poor guy... I don't think he realizes that he won't find\r\n"
"any girls at the telephone club's physical location.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"(Oh, well. If I ever feel like it, I can call this telephone\r\n"
"club here and see if I can find a girl named Nami...)"
msgstr ""

